  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>늦게 올리네요..ㅠ.ㅠ</p><p>생물분류 활동한 활동지와</p><p>학생들 결과사진입니다.ㅎㅎ</p><p><br></p><p>공간이 부족해서 알아서 각 생물종류를 붙이라고 하니</p><p>요&#47223;게 창의적인 아이들이 있어서 같이 올려요.ㅎㅎ<br></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D686%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20190823103115&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile296.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99960F505D5F413131716A')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 생물의 분류 활동지.pptx</a></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99498B425D5F41C831\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1280\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"c_0ibUd018svc194rbyikixou5_em9zjv.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1280\"  id=\"A_99498B425D5F41C831F60A\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99521D425D5F41C830\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"c_0ibUd018svc16lq4ibxk14zx_em9zjv.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_99521D425D5F41C8300610\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9949D7425D5F41C931\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"c_2ibUd018svcs9i0zztg1msk_em9zjv.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_9949D7425D5F41C931E0A4\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/995018425D5F41C930\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1280\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"c_3ibUd018svc1h2tox5k9t2ln_em9zjv.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1280\"  id=\"A_995018425D5F41C930FAF2\"/></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
